      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تشمّس</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man) <i>sat in the sun,</i> or <i>sunshine:</i> (TA:) <i>he set himself up</i> [or <i>exposed himself standing</i>] <i>to the sun.</i> (S, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تشمّس</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْهِ</span> <i>He was niggardly, tenacious,</i> or <i>avaricious,
to him.</i> (TA.) [See also the part. n., below.]

